    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Mazey Village \u2013 A Cozy Adventure Awaits \ud83c\udf3f</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A tornado has torn through a peaceful village, leaving the villagers with broken homes and their precious belongings scattered across the maze-like land.<br><br>As a skilled maze navigator, it's up to you to explore, recover what was lost, and help rebuild the town into something even better than before!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1766240/extras/a72385c28ba7056a7745b516068f903d.poster.avif?t=1753769081\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1766240/extras/a72385c28ba7056a7745b516068f903d.webm?t=1753769081\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Explore a World Full of Hidden Treasures \u2728</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Journey through forests, ruins, and snowy landscapes, retrieving lost items and meeting charming creatures along the way. Every path leads to new discoveries, friendly faces, and maybe even a few surprises.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Search for lost belongings hidden throughout the mazey world.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Befriend villagers and quirky talking animals.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Meet tiny critters who might just lend a helping hand.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1766240/extras/03f6c08cccda9a35c2f7bb3f9c6e4a88.poster.avif?t=1753769081\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1766240/extras/03f6c08cccda9a35c2f7bb3f9c6e4a88.webm?t=1753769081\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Rebuild and Customize the Village \ud83c\udfe1</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Design the town by placing decorations and shaping its layout, creating a cozy space that matches your style. </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Restore homes and welcome villagers back.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Decorate with furniture, gardens, and charming details.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Watch the village flourish as you bring the community together!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1766240/extras/739ddfc55b9f37e84f8dad09f621b4fb.poster.avif?t=1753769081\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1766240/extras/739ddfc55b9f37e84f8dad09f621b4fb.webm?t=1753769081\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>A Charming World Full of Life \ud83d\udc2e</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">From petting cows and penguins to uncovering hidden stories, <i>Mazey Village</i> is full of little moments that make every step of the adventure special. Help the villagers, make new friends, and bring warmth back to the town.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Are you ready to begin your journey? <strong>The village is waiting for you!</strong><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1766240/extras/319ff4fc1d72537425934aae1064ae3b.poster.avif?t=1753769081\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1766240/extras/319ff4fc1d72537425934aae1064ae3b.webm?t=1753769081\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div> </p>",
